pakistan-address contains data derived from:

1. Pakistan - Subnational Administrative Boundaries (COD-AB)
   World Food Programme SDI / OCHA, via the Humanitarian Data Exchange
   https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-pak
   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution for Intergovernmental Organisations (CC BY-IGO).
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/
   Changes: administrative unit names, parent relationships and p-codes were extracted from the
   attribute tables, merged with the source below, and some names normalised. The original workbook is in
   data-sources/hdx/. This is not an official product of, and is not endorsed by, WFP or OCHA.

2. Pakistan Bureau of Statistics, Population Census 2023
   Digital census portal, https://census23.pbos.gov.pk/
   Official statistics of the Government of Pakistan. The publisher states no licence. Only the names and codes of
   administrative units (provinces, divisions, districts, tehsils) were read from the portal's dropdown lists, and
   they are attributed to it. The extracted list is in data-sources/census2023/. Not endorsed by PBS.

3. Government of the Punjab, Revenue Department, Notification No. 479-2024/6904-DIR(DEV&G), 18 December 2024
   Official notification of the divisions, districts and tehsils of the Punjab. Only the names of administrative units
   were used. Transcribed in data-sources/punjab-2024/ from a scanned copy published by Minute Mirror.

4. aaqibmehran/geo-pakistan (https://github.com/aaqibmehran/geo-pakistan)
   Copyright (c) Aaqib Mehran
   Licensed under the MIT License (declared in the project's composer.json).
   The original PHP seeders are kept unmodified in data-sources/geo-pakistan/.

5. Delivery areas (UNOFFICIAL), data/delivery-areas.json, the `pakistan-address/delivery` entry point
   Province, city and zone names taken from the address form of an online store, collected in October 2026.
   Only place names were kept (no other store content, ids or markup), and the names were cleaned as described in data-sources/delivery/build-report.md. It is kept apart from
   the official data and is labelled unofficial. The store's own terms and any rights in its lists are not
   covered by this package's MIT licence, and this package is not affiliated with or endorsed by the store.
   If the owner of the source objects to its inclusion, remove data/delivery-areas.json and src/delivery.ts.
